अन्तावसायिन् (or अन्तावशायिन्), m. a barber, L.
 a Cāṇḍāla, MārkP. &c., cf. अन्ते-ऽवसायिन्;
 N. of a Muni, L.

अन्तावसायिन् (or अन्तावशायिन्), m. a barber, L.
 a Cāṇḍāla, MārkP. &c., cf. अन्ते-ऽवसायिन्;
 N. of a Muni, L.

1. अन्तर्-√ धा Ā. -धत्ते, to place within, deposit;
to receive within;
to hide, conceal, obscure;
to hide one's self:
Pass. -धीयते to be received within, to be absorbed;
to be rendered invisible;
to disappear, vanish;
to cease:
Caus. -धापयति;
to render invisible, to cause to disappear.

अन्तर्-√ इ -अयति to come between, Mṛcch.;
 (perf. -अयां चकार) to conceal, cause to disappear, Śiś. iii, 24;
 -एति to stand in any one's way, separate;
to exclude from (abl., rarely gen.);
to pass over, omit;
to disappear:
Intens. -ईयते, to walk to and fro between (as a mediator), RV.
